"","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Illustration_Prunus_persica_clean_no_descr.jpg"}},"ingredient/starch":{"t":"ingredient","r":"ingredient/starch","n":"Starch","c":"#c9b8dd","crumb":[["Ingredients","ingredients"]],"sub":"Ingredient in 5 dishes across 6 cuisines","intro":[["Starch is a carbohydrate consisting of numerous glucose units joined by glycosidic bonds. This polysaccharide is produced by most green plants for energy storage. Worldwide, it is the most common carbohydrate in human diets, and is contained in large amounts in staple foods such as wheat, potatoes, maize (corn), rice, and cassava (manioc)."]],"src":"wikipedia","actions":[{"kind":"globe","hash":"ingredient-starch"},{"kind":"wiki","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Starch"}],"sections":[{"h":"Where it's cooked with","count":6,"groups":[["Belarusian cuisine","cuisine/belarusian-cuisine",[["Zatiruha","dish/zatiruha"]]],["Colombian cuisine","cuisine/colombian-cuisine",[["Pandebono","dish/pandebono"]]],["Levantine cuisine","cuisine/levantine-cuisine",[["Zalabiyeh","dish/zalabiyeh"]]],["Palestinian cuisine","cuisine/palestinian-cuisine",[["Zalabiyeh","dish/zalabiyeh"]]],["Swedish cuisine","cuisine/swedish-cuisine",[["Blåbärssoppa","dish/blabarssoppa"]]],["Taiwan cuisine","cuisine/taiwan-cuisine",[["Pork ball","dish/pork-ball"]]]]},{"h":"Often cooked with","links":[["Sugar","ingredient/sugar"],["Egg","ingredient/egg"],["Wheat flour","ingredient/wheat-flour"],["Bilberries","ingredient/bilberries"],["Bilberry","ingredient/bilberry"],["Potato starch","ingredient/potato-starch"],["Cassava","ingredient/cassava"],["Cheese","ingredient/cheese"],["Corn starch","ingredient/corn-starch"],["Pork","ingredient/pork"],["Rose water","ingredient/rose-water"],["Yeast","ingredient/yeast"],["Yogurt","ingredient/yogurt"],["Broth","ingredient/broth"],["Buckwheat flour","ingredient/buckwheat-flour"],["Milk","ingredient/milk"]]}],"img":{"src":"/world-cuisine/img/thumb/d/d5/Cornstarch_mixed_with_water.jpg/500px