home cook Manuela sharing classic family and regional Italian dishes.","url":"https://www.manusmenu.com/about/about-this-site","suggested":true,"kind":"blog"}]},{"h":"More from Italian cuisine","links":[["Acquacotta","dish/acquacotta"],["Agliata","dish/agliata"],["Agnolotti","dish/agnolotti"],["Antipasto","dish/antipasto"],["Arancini","dish/arancini"],["Biscotti","dish/biscotti"],["Bolinhos de bacalhau","dish/bolinhos-de-bacalhau"],["Bombolone","dish/bombolone"],["Budino","dish/budino"],["Cabbage roll","dish/cabbage-roll"],["Caesar salad","dish/caesar-salad"],["Cannelloni","dish/cannelloni"],["Capellini","dish/capellini"],["Carbonara","dish/carbonara"],["Carpaccio","dish/carpaccio"],["Cassatella di sant'Agata","dish/cassatella-di-sant-agata"],["Cassoeula","dish/cassoeula"],["Ciabatta","dish/ciabatta"],["Cioppino","dish/cioppino"],["Coda alla vaccinara","dish/coda-alla-vaccinara"],["Colomba pasquale","dish/colomba-pasquale"],["Conti roll","dish/conti-roll"],["Cotoletta alla bolognese","dish/cotoletta-alla-bolognese"],["Crostata","dish/crostata"],["Drago restaurants","dish/drago-restaurants"],["Focaccia pugliese","dish/focaccia-pugliese"],["Frittata","dish/frittata"],["Giardiniera","dish/giardiniera"],["Guanciale","dish/guanciale"],["Italian restaurant","dish/italian-restaurant"],["Italian wedding soup","dish/italian-wedding-soup"],["Lampredotto","dish/lampredotto"],["Lasagna","dish/lasagna"],["List of Italian restaurants","dish/list-of-italian-restaurants"],["Marinara sauce","dish/marinara-sauce"],["Mondeghili","dish/mondeghili"],["Paccheri","dish/paccheri"],["Panini (sandwich)","dish/panini-sandwich"],["Panna cotta","dish/panna-cotta"],["Passatelli","dish/passatelli"]]}],"img":{"src":"/world-cuisine/img/thumb/8/89/Saltimbocca_alla_Romana.jpg/500px-Saltimbocca_alla_Romana.jpg","w":500,"h":444,"by":"Alec Vuijlsteke","lic":"CC BY 2.0","licUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/2.0","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Saltimbocca_alla_Romana.jpg"}},"dish/vigoron":{"t":"dish","r":"dish/vigoron","n":"Vigorón","c":"#ede6da","crumb":[["Dishes","dishes"]],"sub":"Dish from Nicaraguan cuisine","dot":"#94bd5c","intro":[["Vigorón is a traditional Nicaraguan dish. It consists of a cabbage salad, or curtido (chopped cabbage, tomatoes, onions, and chili pepper marinated in vinegar and salt), boiled yuca, and chicharrones (fried pork belly or fried pork rinds), over a banana leaf.  This dish is often eaten without utensils, and it is frequently served to visiting family and guests, as it is generally easily and quickly prepared."]],"src":"wikipedia","actions":[{"kind":"globe","hash":"dish-vigoron"},{"kind":"wiki","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Vigor%C3%B3n"}],"sections":[{"h":"Where it's from","links":[["Nicaraguan cuisine","cuisine/nicaraguan-cuisine"]]},{"h":"Ingredients","count":1,"links":[["Chicharrón","ingredient/chicharron"]]}],"img":{"src":"/world-cuisine/img/thumb/0/09/VIGORON.JPG/500px-VIGORON.JPG","w":500,"h":375,"by":"Nicaraguan food","lic":"Public domain","licUrl":"","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:VIGORON.JPG"}}}